1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:02,775
In this town, every year, everyone swaps names.

2
00:00:03,627 --> 00:00:06,604
At midnight, on New Year's, your name tag changes.

3
00:00:07,593 --> 00:00:09,358
And whatever name you get...

4
00:00:09,927 --> 00:00:11,692
that's who you are now.

5
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:14,328
Your job. Your house. Your family.

6
00:00:14,993 --> 00:00:17,411
Last year, the baker became a firefighter.

7
00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:19,925
The firefighter became the mayor.

8
00:00:20,493 --> 00:00:22,258
The mayor became a baby.

9
00:00:22,827 --> 00:00:24,592
It's chaos. But it's tradition.

10
00:00:25,160 --> 00:00:27,834
Everyone wears their name tag at all times.

11
00:00:28,727 --> 00:00:32,310
This year, I got a name nobody had ever heard of.

12
00:00:33,527 --> 00:00:35,595
Nobody in town had that name.

13
00:00:36,260 --> 00:00:38,328
No house. No job. No family.

14
00:00:38,993 --> 00:00:41,062
The mayor checked the town records.

15
00:00:41,727 --> 00:00:43,189
"This name doesn't exist."

16
00:00:43,660 --> 00:00:45,122
So I went looking.

17
00:00:45,593 --> 00:00:46,752
The old library.

18
00:00:47,393 --> 00:00:48,552
The town archive.

19
00:00:49,193 --> 00:00:50,093
The cemetery.

20
00:00:50,993 --> 00:00:51,546
Nothing.

21
00:00:52,793 --> 00:00:54,255
Then I found it.

22
00:00:54,727 --> 00:00:56,795
Carved under the town clock tower.

23
00:00:57,460 --> 00:00:58,316
One name.

24
00:00:59,260 --> 00:00:59,813
Mine.

25
00:01:01,060 --> 00:01:02,219
And a date.

26
00:01:02,860 --> 00:01:04,625
Exactly one hundred years ago.

27
00:01:05,193 --> 00:01:06,958
Under it, a little door.

28
00:01:07,527 --> 00:01:08,686
I opened it.

29
00:01:09,327 --> 00:01:11,395
Inside, there was a dusty room.

30
00:01:12,060 --> 00:01:12,916
A bed.

31
00:01:13,860 --> 00:01:14,716
A desk.

32
00:01:15,660 --> 00:01:17,425
And a kid sitting there.

33
00:01:17,993 --> 00:01:18,546
Waiting.

34
00:01:19,793 --> 00:01:21,558
He looked up at me.

35
00:01:22,127 --> 00:01:23,286
"Finally," he said.

36
00:01:23,927 --> 00:01:26,904
"I've been wearing your name for a hundred years."

37
00:01:27,893 --> 00:01:29,658
He pointed at my chest.

38
00:01:30,227 --> 00:01:31,992
My name tag was changing.

39
00:01:32,560 --> 00:01:33,719
Letter by letter.

40
00:01:34,360 --> 00:01:35,519
To his name.

